    <briefdescription>
<para>NMEA 2000 Fast-Packet RX Re-assembly Context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Tracks one active <computeroutput>(<ref refid="structSYN__N2K__FastPacketRx_1ad53191ff84a42d972fc74085b035fde8" kindref="member">pgn</ref>, <ref refid="structSYN__N2K__FastPacketRx_1a65e40a094eccdd7bdfaca6a804427aba" kindref="member">sa</ref>)</computeroutput> Fast-Packet session at a time. Concurrent Frame 0 arrivals from another source address are rejected with SYN_BUSY until the active session completes, aborts on a sequence break, is cleared via <ref refid="syn__n2k_8c_1af7b5c35d29d00f0185c44353377a5888" kindref="member">syn_n2k_fastpacket_reset()</ref>, or expires after SYN_N2K_FASTPACKET_TIMEOUT_MS. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
